      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a crushing weight of expectation, perhaps thinking that protecting others means enduring all the pain yourself, which is an extremely heavy thing to ask of anyone. But treating yourself just as a vessel to be extinguished might cut you off from the very people who could help you heal and finally break the cycle. You have the unique power to choose your own story for the first time, and your existence should not be defined solely by preventing pain for others.",
